    10	      = -(42/(c_f c_g)) t^20.                                    (J)
    11	
    12	Rows k = 0..41 are pure y-side; k != 20 homogeneous.  Machinery reused
    13	READ-ONLY from cases/r1_experiment.py (ring, VExpr, gm_jet2 chart
    14	products); VDEG_CAP raised so all rows k < D are EXACT (var degree <=
    15	slot; no sentinel loss — asserted).
    16	
    17	Phases: gate | rows [D] | all      (default D = 7)
    18	"""
    19	import sys, os, time
