+For a stream of residue \(\rho\), its global \(t\)-shift is
+
+\[
+ r_\rho=6+\rho\quad(\rho\ne4),\qquad r_4=16,              \tag{1.1}
+\]
+
+where \(r_4=16\), rather than \(10\), records `PIN42`. Thus
