+\[
+ X=\bigoplus_{q=1}^{30}t^{r_q}k[[u]],\qquad \sum_qr_q=288. \tag{1.2}
+\]
+
+The corrected target is
+
+\[
+ Y^+=\bigoplus_{a=0}^{29}t^{s_a}k[[u]]e_a,               \tag{1.3}
+\]
+
+where
+
+\[
+ s_a=6+2((a+1)\bmod3)\quad(0\le a\le28),\qquad
+ s_{28}=16,\qquad s_{29}=36,                             \tag{1.4}
+\]
