band-41 regression does not prove this. The discovery of \(H_{29}\) after the
old 29-stream assertion is the concrete warning against extrapolating the
regression.

### CONJECTURE BRIDGE-30 (pristine/emitted ideal bridge)

After the named base specialization and chart localization, the ideal of the
full pristine depth tower equals the levelwise ideal generated by the 30
\(H_a\), and every emitted Schur/pivot presentation is connected to it by
compatible two-sided transformations over chart units. Set-theoretic equality
and radical equality are explicitly insufficient.

SOURCE-30 would prove the coefficient part of this conjecture through
Proposition 5.1. The reconstruction/presentation part still needs exact
certificates.

### CONJECTURE PARAM-30 (pointwise all-depth Ore section)

For any point advertised as `LIVE`, its fully specified corrected operator
\(L_s^+\) admits an exact causal right section satisfying (7.2) with the
advertised finite loss. A proof must close the initial transient and every
