   176	The second route is plausible because θ preserves the \(t\)-filtration, but multiples of \(p\) are a real resonance hazard. Until one route is banked, tomorrow's \(e\le11\) is `E_CANDIDATE`, **not yet a certified formal germ**. Once the theorem and bridge gates pass, \(e\le11\) at any D23 witness is indeed the campaign headline.
