+The Newton theorem does not use this defect/index diagnostic. Let
+\(\ell^+=\ell(L_s^+)\) be the minimal loss (2.1), and let
+
+\[
+ e^+_{\rm cert}:=\text{any proved upper bound on \(\ell^+\) realized by
+ a section satisfying (7.2)}.                              \tag{8.4}
+\]
