+\[
+                              \boxed{\ell^+\ge37}:        \tag{8.7}
+\]
+
+for every \(e\le36\), that target lies in \(F^eY^+\) but not in \(L_s^+(X)\).
+This concerns exactly six witnesses times three deep draws times two primes
